   "source": [
    "# MomentFlow: Apple 2-Model GPU Backend (Kaggle Production Deployment)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook deploys the **MomentFlow Video Temporal Grounding Compute Engine** on Kaggle's free Nvidia Tesla T4 or P100 GPU (16 GB VRAM).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Models Loaded on CUDA FP16:\n",
    "1. **Model 1: `apple/MobileCLIP-B`** (147M parameters) — FastViT hybrid vision encoder for temporal frame trajectory scanning.\n",
    "2. **Model 2: `apple/FastVLM-0.5B`** (0.5B parameters) — FastViTHD vision-language model (85× faster TTFT) for keyframe verification.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Total Footprint:\n",
    "- Static VRAM Consumption: **2.6 GB / 16.0 GB**\n",
    "- Free GPU Headroom: **>13.4 GB**\n",
    "\n",
    "### How It Connects to Render:\n",
    "This notebook exposes a secure, public HTTPS URL via **Cloudflare Tunnel** (`pycloudflared`).\n",
    "You copy this URL and paste it into your free **Render Web Service** as `KAGGLE_BACKEND_URL`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# [1] Verify Kaggle Nvidia GPU Accelerator\n",
    "!nvidia-smi\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "assert torch.cuda.is_available(), \"ERROR: GPU Accelerator not enabled! In Kaggle sidebar, set Accelerator -> GPU T4 x2 or GPU P100.\"\n",
    "print(f\"CUDA Device: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"VRAM Available: {torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_memory / (1024**3):.2f} GB\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# [2] Clone Repository & Install Dependencies\n",
    "!git clone https://github.com/pactaccount/MomentFlow.git\n",
    "%cd MomentFlow/Prototype\n",
    "!pip install --upgrade pip -q\n",
    "!pip install -r requirements.txt pycloudflared -q\n",
    "print(\"Repository cloned and dependencies installed successfully!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# [3] Launch Production GPU Server with Cloudflare Tunnel\n",
    "!python kaggle_deploy.py"
   ]
  }
